assport are to travel with you, it is essential that they also get e-VISA.\n\n3. Issuance of e-VISA does not guarantee entry to the Republic of Indonesia, the decision of entry remains the right of the Immigration Officer at the port of entry.\n\n4. Holders of e-VISA are not required to queue at the visa payment counter and can proceed directly to Immigration Counter at the port of entry upon arrival. You must present passport that is valid for more than 6 (six) months and return ticket to the Immigration Officer.\n\n5. E-VISA shall not be valid for purposes other than tourism, government visit, business meeting,goods purchasing,or transit. Visa applications such as work, study, etc. must be made via e-VISA application. It is your own responsibility to check whether your residence permit has expired or not.\n\n6. If your period of stay exceed 30 (thirty) days in Indonesia,overstay fine will be applied.\n\n7. For more information, please visit http://www.imigrasi.go.id.\n\nEVISA RECEIPT\n\n04/07/2025 16:37:43\n\n","pages":[{"angle":0,"content":[{"score":1,"text":"","type":"line","id":0,"pos":[82,55,135,55,134,114,82,114]},{"id":1,"pos":[82,55,135,55,134,114,82,114],"size":[50,56],"type":"image","data":{"path":"","region":[82,55,135,55,134,114,82,114]}},{"id":2,"pos":[142,52,209,52,209,116,142,116],"score":1,"text":"","type":"line"},{"type":"image","data":{"path":"","region":[142,52,209,52,209,116,142,116]},"id":3,"pos":[142,52,209,52,209,116,142,116],"size":[64,62]},{"id":4,"pos":[835,53,1136,53,1136,138,835,138],"score":0.7680000066757202,"text":"EVISA","type":"line"},{"id":5,"pos":[81,120,325,120,325,140,81,140],"score":0.9950000047683716,"text":"KEMENTERIAN HUKUM DAN HAM RI","type":"line"},{"score":0.9990000128746033,"text":"DIREKTORAT JENDERAL IMIGRASI","type":"line","id":6,"pos":[81,138,490,138,490,167,81,167]},{"id":7,"pos":[921,152,1053,152,1053,173,921,173],"score":0.984000027179718,"text":"Electronic Visa","type":"line"},{"id":8,"pos":[1049,187,1142,187,1142